sequenceDiagram
    participant PodA as Control Plane Pod A
    participant PodB as Control Plane Pod B
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    participant Client as External Client

    Note over PodA, PodB: Both pods start
    PodA->>PodA: isLeader = false
    PodB->>PodB: isLeader = false

    Note over PodA, PodB: Leader election triggered
    PodA->>PodA: becomeLeader()
    PodA->>PodA: isLeader = true
    PodA->>PodA: start tick() loop
    Note over PodA: Scheduler active

    PodB->>PodB: isLeader = false
    PodB->>PodB: tick() not started
    Note over PodB: Standby — no scheduler activity

    Client->>LB: GET /api/workflows
    LB->>PodA: request routed to Pod A
    PodA-->>Client: workflow list

    Client->>LB: GET /api/snapshots
    LB->>PodB: request routed to Pod B
    PodB-->>Client: snapshot list
    Note over PodA, PodB: Both serve read requests

    alt Pod A fails
        PodA-->>xPodA: crash
        PodB->>PodB: detect leader loss (heartbeat timeout)
        PodB->>PodB: becomeLeader()
        PodB->>PodB: start tick() loop
        Note over PodB: Now the active scheduler
    end

    alt Pod A recovers
        PodA->>PodA: isLeader = false
        PodA->>PodA: detect existing leader
        Note over PodA: Remains standby
    end
